The pilot's 208 branch-free body slices `K2 .. K210` (6035 instructions) re-checked at the
cuts rebased by `shiftK8 0` (the parts `P1..P4`, generated by `tools/avx_x8w.py`), and
composed:

* `body_runW`: the first pass, from the rebased `K2` reached by the entry
  (`Avx2X8WShift.sliceE_0`), at any count `c = σ 2 ≥ 8`;
* `bodyV_runW`: every later pass, from the loop invariant head `KH 0` through the two
  replayed cuts (`sliceV2_0`, `sliceV3_0`) and then the pass-1 cuts from `K4` on.

